"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Saturday, February 28th at ActiveImagination on Montgomery avenue.<br /> <br /> Attendance will garner proceeds to help food distribution and hunger prevention programs.<br /> <br /> Do it for Gaia.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I am the one running it. It is at 4pm-8pm at Active Imagination. I am finishing up the SL. This is the official write up.<br /> <br /> <b>Werewolf: The Apocalypse <i>Rage Across Tokyo, a Modern Hengeyokai One Shot</i></b><br /> <br /> <i>The SoHo District in Tokyo is famous for their various games and shops that attract young and old from around the country if not the world. Lately there have been disappearances of young teenage girls in the SoHo district. The Council of the Emerald Lady are concerned that some evil is afoot and have sent a young Sentai (a Pack of Mixed Changing Breeds) to investigate for they can pass themselves off as Teenagers themselves: The Honorable Hakken (Werewolf) from a Noble Samurai Line, the Kitsune (Werefox) Sorceress, the Stargazer (Werewolf) Shaolin Metis, the happy talkative Tengu (Wereraven) and the Silent Deadly Nezumi (Wererat) are about to embark on a journey deep in the SoHo District's depths where their lives may very much be imperil as stories if Goblin Spiders dance in the air. </i><br /> <br /> All Characters are pregenerated for this Adventure. No experience needed. Just bring D10s and lots of them and an imagination. <br /> <br /> <br /> Make sure to bring canned goods this is a food drive for Roadrunner Food Bank hosted by the Dukes of Dice. <br /> <br /> There are also Raffled Prizes as well from donated games, each ticket comes from donated food item. We are asking Dry or Canned. Help us out for a good cause.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4949-nene-richards","name":"